# Alterac Mountains - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Alliance route through the mountain crossing between Hillsbrad and the
# Plaguelands: the Dalaran crater wizards west, the writ turn-ins central, the
# Syndicate documents south, Bath'rah and Myrokos south-east, then expedition
# legs to Hillsbrad and Stranglethorn. Contract: 20 quests
# (19 turn-ins; 96783 is an accept-only record with no turn-in in the data).
# This round clears the Hillsbrad debt: 510 feeds contracted 512 and 511 feeds
# contracted 514 (both Hillsbrad), so those chains now read end to end. Soft-pre
# accepts whose blocking pre-quest sits outside the contract (602 for 603,
# 1791 for 1712, 6681 for 96781/96783) carry a note at the accept; the Cyclonian
# and Ravenholdt completes stand alone in `when onquest` mini-steps. R2/R5
# accepted classes: sourceless writ starters (bag notes), off-zone Bloodscalp
# Tusks for 1712 (Stranglethorn bag note), spawnless objective sources
# (Zum'rah, Zalfan Moonshadow, Coldbringer's Eye, Gurubashi Idol, Blade/Aegis —
# bag notes with bare completes). No race header: no quest is race-locked
# (races are Alliance or neutral throughout) — per-line class gates only
# (Warrior, Rogue). See docs/alterac-census.md for the full ledger.
guide butler-routes-completionist/alterac-mountains
title Alterac Mountains - Completionist
levels 30-40
zone Alterac Mountains
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step The Dalaran crater — Ansirem's key

  tip Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver (14.16, 59.73) works the crater west.
  goto 14.16,59.73
  note 603's pre (602 Magical Analysis, Stranglethorn, out of contract) fills outside this route - take 603 here.
  accept 603 only Alliance -- Ansirem's Key - Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver; Catelyn takes it in Stranglethorn, late

step The Dalaran crater — Olvek and Nightstride

  goto 9.51,62.25
  accept 96800 only Alliance -- Past Due - Magus Olvek; the Runemasters' magic
  note The Lost Magic of the Runemasters names no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  complete 96800 only Alliance
  turnin 96800 only Alliance -- Past Due - the Runemasters' magic to Magus Olvek
  goto 17.8,65.95
  accept 96771 only Alliance -- Vengeance of the Highborne - Ranath Nightstride; Zalfan Moonshadow, at 37
  note Zalfan Moonshadow has no placed spawn in the data - take him if he is up by the post.
  complete 96771 only Alliance
  turnin 96771 only Alliance -- Vengeance of the Highborne - to Ranath Nightstride

step The Dalaran crater — the high wizards

  goto 15.3,73.93
  accept 96770 only Alliance -- The Witch Doctor's Head - Archmage Lan'dalock; Zum'rah's Head, at 39
  note Zum'rah has no placed spawn in the data - have his Head in your bags.
  complete 96770 only Alliance
  turnin 96770 only Alliance -- The Witch Doctor's Head - to Archmage Lan'dalock
  accept 96773 only Alliance -- The Coldbringer's Eye - Archmage Lan'dalock; the Eye, at 34
  note The Coldbringer's Eye names no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  complete 96773 only Alliance
  turnin 96773 only Alliance -- The Coldbringer's Eye - to Archmage Lan'dalock
  goto 15.37,74.09
  accept 97130 only Alliance -- Ancient Gurubashi Secrets - Archmage Timear; the Idol, at 34
  note The Ancient Gurubashi Idol's only dropper has no placed spawn in the data - have it in your bags.
  complete 97130 only Alliance
  turnin 97130 only Alliance -- Ancient Gurubashi Secrets - to Archmage Timear

step Central Alterac — writ: elixir (Alchemy)

  when skill Alchemy 1

  goto 38.4,61.13
  accept 94004 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Elixir of Ogre's Strength - Sos'mol; back to Sos'mol, at 60
  note 94004's starter (the writ) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  turnin 94004 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Elixir of Ogre's Strength - back to Sos'mol

step Central Alterac — writ: leather ball (Leatherworking)

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  goto 38.4,61.13
  accept 94238 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Heavy Leather Ball - Sos'mol; back to Sos'mol, at 60
  note 94238's starter (the writ) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  note The Heavy Leather Ball is a Leatherworking craft, or bought off Flik (Elwynn/Mulgore) - have the Ball in your bags.
  turnin 94238 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Heavy Leather Ball - back to Sos'mol

step Central Alterac — writ: dagger (Blacksmithing)

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  goto 30.62,61.02
  accept 94220 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Pearl-Handled Dagger - Alan Sneeks; back to Alan Sneeks, at 60
  note 94220's starter (the writ) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  turnin 94220 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Pearl-Handled Dagger - back to Alan Sneeks

step Central Alterac — writ: spyglass (Engineering)

  when skill Engineering 1

  goto 30.62,61.02
  accept 94229 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Ornate Spyglass - Alan Sneeks; back to Alan Sneeks, at 60
  note 94229's starter (the writ) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  turnin 94229 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Ornate Spyglass - back to Alan Sneeks

step Central Alterac — writ: robe (Tailoring)

  when skill Tailoring 1

  goto 30.62,61.02
  accept 94247 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Lesser Wizard's Robe - Alan Sneeks; back to Alan Sneeks, at 60
  note 94247's starter (the writ) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  turnin 94247 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Lesser Wizard's Robe - back to Alan Sneeks

step The Syndicate cache — documents

  tip The Syndicate Documents (58.28, 67.92) sit in the cache south.
  goto 58.28,67.92
  accept 510 only Alliance -- Foreboding Plans - the Syndicate Documents; Maleb takes them in Hillsbrad, late
  accept 511 only Alliance -- Encrypted Letter - the Syndicate Documents; Dibbs takes it in Hillsbrad, late

step The south-east — Bath'rah

  tip Bath'rah the Windwatcher (80.5, 66.92) holds the south-east.
  goto 80.5,66.92
  note 1712's pre (1791 The Windwatcher, out of contract — ends here) fills outside this route - take 1712 here.
  accept 1712 only Warrior -- Cyclonian - Bath'rah the Windwatcher; Liferoot, Tusks and Exile
  note Bloodscalp Tusks drop off the Bloodscalps in Stranglethorn, none on 1416 - take thirty Tusks and have them in your bags.
  note The Essence of the Exile names no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  collect 3357 x8 quest 1712.1 @13.54,55.4 era -- Liferoot off the nodes west for Bath'rah the Windwatcher

step The south-east — writ: pants (Leatherworking)

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  goto 80.5,66.92
  accept 94251 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Phoenix Pants - Bath'rah the Windwatcher; back to Bath'rah, at 60
  note 94251's starter (the writ) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  turnin 94251 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Phoenix Pants - back to Bath'rah the Windwatcher

step The far south-east — Myrokos

  tip Myrokos Silentform (84.93, 80.38) runs the Ravenholdt cell far south-east.
  goto 84.93,80.38
  note 96781's pre (6681 The Manor, Ravenholdt, out of contract — below band) fills outside this route - take 96781 here.
  accept 96781 only Rogue -- What's the Big Idea? - Myrokos Silentform; Barton's Scouting Report
  collect 275482 quest 96781.1 @60.23,46.53 era -- Barton's Scouting Report off Barton for Myrokos Silentform
  note 96783's pre (6681, out of contract) fills outside this route - take 96783 here.
  accept 96783 only Rogue -- A Way In - Myrokos Silentform; accept-only, no turn-in in the data
  note 96783 has no ender and no objectives in the data - bank the accept; there is nothing to turn in.

step Bath'rah — the Cyclonian line

  when onquest 1712

  goto 80.5,66.92
  complete 1712 only Warrior
  turnin 1712 only Warrior -- Cyclonian - Liferoot, Tusks and Exile to Bath'rah the Windwatcher
  note 1713's pre (1712 above) fills at this turn-in - take 1713 here.
  accept 1713 only Warrior -- The Summoning - Bath'rah the Windwatcher; the Whirlwind Heart off Cyclonian
  complete 1713 only Warrior @80.32,62.14 era -- the Whirlwind Heart off Cyclonian for Bath'rah the Windwatcher
  turnin 1713 only Warrior -- The Summoning - the Heart to Bath'rah the Windwatcher
  note 1792's pre (1713 above) fills at this turn-in - take 1792 here.
  accept 1792 only Warrior -- Whirlwind Weapon - Bath'rah the Windwatcher; no objectives
  turnin 1792 only Warrior -- Whirlwind Weapon - back to Bath'rah the Windwatcher

step Myrokos — extraction

  when onquest 96781

  goto 84.93,80.38
  complete 96781 only Rogue
  turnin 96781 only Rogue -- What's the Big Idea? - the Report to Myrokos Silentform
  note 96782's pre (96781 above) fills at this turn-in - take 96782 here.
  accept 96782 only Rogue -- Covert Extraction - Myrokos Silentform; the Blade and the Aegis
  note The Blade of House Perenolde and the Royal Aegis of Perenolde name no placed source in the data - have them in your bags.
  complete 96782 only Rogue
  turnin 96782 only Rogue -- Covert Extraction - the Blade and Aegis to Myrokos Silentform

step Expedition — Hillsbrad, Maleb's rings

  when onquest 510

  zone map 1424

  tip Magistrate Henry Maleb (48.14, 59.11) holds Southshore.
  goto 48.14,59.11
  turnin 510 only Alliance -- Foreboding Plans - the Documents to Magistrate Henry Maleb
  zone map 1416

step Expedition — Hillsbrad, Dibbs's letter

  when onquest 511

  zone map 1424

  tip Loremaster Dibbs (50.57, 57.09) studies in Southshore.
  goto 50.57,57.09
  turnin 511 only Alliance -- Encrypted Letter - the Documents to Loremaster Dibbs
  zone map 1416

step Expedition — Stranglethorn, Catelyn's blade

  when onquest 603

  zone map 1434

  tip Catelyn the Blade (27.28, 77.53) waits down the cape.
  goto 27.28,77.53
  turnin 603 only Alliance -- Ansirem's Key - the Key to Catelyn the Blade
  zone map 1416

